{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:39bae85f284ce360","name":"Jedi Sentinel Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-39bae85f284ce360","title":"Jedi Sentinel Talent Tree","revision":26765,"timestamp":"2025-07-18T23:04:16Z","sha256":"949b438c53f05759201ebbe66181fdf077ebf7536604478f0eefd07abbf028ec","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26765","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Jedi%20Sentinel%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-39bae85f284ce360","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," that follow the path of the Sentinel are the true enemies of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},", hunting down evil and stopping the spread of darkness wherever they go. You are a master of subtlety and difficult to tempt with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},", even when constantly confronted by its power.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Clear Mind"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You may reroll any opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check made to oppose ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Force"}," checks. You must take the result of the reroll, even if it is worse.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Dark Side Sense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," following the path of the Sentinel become exceptionally talented at rooting out evil. You may reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check made to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Force"}," against the presence and relative location of characters with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," of 1 or higher. You must take the result of the reroll, even if it is worse.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Dark Side Scourge"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Dark Side Sense"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Against creatures with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," of 1 or higher, you deal extra damage on melee attacks equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," bonus (minimum +1).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Force Haze"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Clear Mind"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," to create a \"Haze\" that hides you and your allies from the perception of others. You can hide a number of creatures in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," equal to your Class Level. Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check and compare the result to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," of any opponent that moves into ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," of any creature hidden by your ",{"tag":"b","children":["Force Haze"]},". If your check result equals or exceeds the opponent's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},", all hidden creatures are treated as if they had ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Concealment"}," against the opponent.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"b","children":["Force Haze"]}," lasts for up to 1 minute but is dismissed instantly if anyone hidden by the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Force Haze"]}," makes an attack.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You may use this Talent to hide a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," while you are on board. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," can't have a size penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," checks greater than your Heroic Level. Thus, a Gargantuan Starship (size penalty of -5) can be hidden only by a character of 5th level or higher.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Resist the Dark Side"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Dark Side Sense"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You gain a +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus to all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defense"}," scores against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side"}]},"] descriptor, and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," originating from any dark Force-user (that is, any Force-use whose ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," equals their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," score).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Dampen Presence"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you interact with another sentient creature, you can use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to reduce the impression you leave on it. When you have finished interacting with the creature, you make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check, and if the check result exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},", it does not remember interacting with you once you are gone.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A target that is higher in level than you gains a +5 bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," to resist this ability. This is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mind-Affecting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mind-Affecting"}," effect.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Dark Retaliation"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Sentinel Strike"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to activate a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," to being targeted by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side"}]},"] descriptor.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Dark Side Bane"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Dark Side Sense"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you use a damage-dealing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," against a creature with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," of 1 or higher, you deal extra damage on a successful hit equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," bonus (minimum +1).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Gradual Resistance"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you take damage from the use of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},", until the end of the encounter you gain a +2 Force bonus to all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defenses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defenses","referenceId":"reference:0d85b79fde210d9c"}," against that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Master of the Great Hunt"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You gain a +1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus on attack rolls and deal +1 die of damage on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," attacks made against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," of 1+.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Persistent Haze"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Clear Mind"]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Force Haze"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever anyone concealed by your use of the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Force Haze"]}," Talent attacks, you maintain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Concealment"}," without having to make another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check. Only those who do not attack remain concealed; the attacker no longer has ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Concealment"},", even when using his Talent.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Prime Targets"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you hit a target with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," attack, if the target has not been attacked since the end of your last turn, you deal +1 die of damage.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Reap Retribution"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you take damage from the use of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},", until the end of the encounter you deal an extra 2 points of damage against the creature that used the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," against you.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Sense Primal Force"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," who spend time in a diverse wilderness learn the nuances of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Living Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Living_Force"}," at work within a wild ecosystem. When within a natural wilderness area, such as a jungle, a forest, a swamp, or plains, you tap into the vibrant Living Force of the area and can use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Surroundings"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Surroundings"}," aspect of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill to detect targets out to a 30-square radius, regardless of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Sentinel Strike"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Any time you attack a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"}," opponent (or one who is denied its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against you) with a damage-dealing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},", or attack with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},", you deal an extra +1d6 points of damage with that attack. This Talent does not affect Force Powers with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side"}]},"] descriptor.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can select this Talent multiple times. Each time you select it, your ",{"tag":"b","children":["Sentinel Strike"]}," damage increases by +1d6 points (maximum +5d6 points of damage).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Sentinel's Gambit"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can designate an adjacent opponent with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," of 1 or higher as the target of this Talent. The designated opponent loses its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against your attacks until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Sentinel's Observation"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," against a target, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus on attack rolls against that target.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Steel Resolve"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," to make a melee attack, you can take a penalty between -1 to -5 on your attack roll and add twice that value (+2 to +10) as an insight bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},". This bonus may not exceed your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"},". The changes to attack rolls and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," last until the start of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Unseen Eyes"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Clear Mind"]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Force Haze"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you use the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Force Haze"]}," Talent, allies hidden by the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Force Haze"]}," can reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check, keeping the better of the two results. Additionally, allies hidden by the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Force Haze"]}," gain a +2 bonus on all damage rolls against foes that are unaware of them.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
